        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0023">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">PC</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">propylene carbonate</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0023">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">Several adjuvants</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">may be used to form this separator. They include, for example, gassing agents. Gassing agents include, for example, tetrazole-based compounds and semicarbazide-based compounds. These materials may be blended into the resins forming the microporous membrane, coated onto a surface of the membrane, or sandwiched between two membranes.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0023">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">tetrazole-based compounds</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">may comprise about 1-40% weight of the membrane, preferably about 10-30% of the membrane.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0023">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">tetrazole-based compound</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is 5-phenyltetrazole (5-PT) commercially available as EXPANDEX from Uniroyal Chemical Co. of Naugatuck, Conn., USA.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0023">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">semicarbazide-based compound</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is p-toluenesulfonyl semicarbazide (TSSC) commercially available as CELOGEN from Uniroyal Chemical Co. of Naugatuck, Conn., USA.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0023">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
